      "id": "idea",
      "narration": "This is Mr. Market's favorite law, because every bad habit dresses up as a reward. That bag of easy dopamine looks so good in the moment. But here is the twist. Your brain does not actually crave the habit itself. It craves the hit it expects to get. So the real question is never willpower. It is which craving you set up to win in advance.",
